; fennec-mongo.dynamic — the concrete NATIVE backends (driver / embedded Burrow), the runtime MONGO_URL
; selector (Dynamic), and the mongosh wire endpoint, over the pure seam (fennec-mongo.backend). Links
; libmongoc + LMDB + TLS, so it is SERVER-ONLY and never ships to JS (the reactive layer depends only on
; the pure seam). Modules: Adapters (Native/Embedded/Dynamic + expose), Wire_server; fennec_mongo_dynamic
; flattens them.
